title: 改革派指導者の辞任
new-page: true 
subtitle: 改革派と我々の政策との対立は、もはや修復できないほど深まった。
tags: event
view-if: reformist_dissent >= 60
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.reformist_strength < 10) {
    Q.workers_spd -= 4; 
    Q.new_middle_spd -= 2; 
    Q.old_middle_spd -= 2; 
    Q.rural_spd -= 2; 
    Q.rb_strength -= 200; 
} else if (Q.reformist_strength < 25) {
    Q.workers_spd -= 5; 
    Q.new_middle_spd -= 3; 
    Q.old_middle_spd -= 3; 
    Q.rural_spd -= 3; 
    Q.rb_strength -= 250; 
} else if (Q.reformist_strength < 40) {
    Q.workers_spd -= 6; 
    Q.new_middle_spd -= 4; 
    Q.old_middle_spd -= 4; 
    Q.rural_spd -= 4; 
    Q.rb_strength -= 300; 
} else if (Q.reformist_strength < 60) {
    Q.workers_spd -= 8; 
    Q.new_middle_spd -= 6; 
    Q.old_middle_spd -= 6; 
    Q.rural_spd -= 6; 
    Q.rb_strength -= 350; 
} else {
    Q.workers_spd -= 10; 
    Q.new_middle_spd -= 8; 
    Q.old_middle_spd -= 8; 
    Q.rural_spd -= 8; 
    Q.rb_strength -= 400; 
}

Q.reformist_strength *= 0.3; 

Q.n_advisors_start = Q.n_advisors; 
if (Q.braun_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1; 
if (Q.severing_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1; 
Q.braun_advisor = 0; 
Q.severing_advisor = 0; 
Q.reformists_resign = 1; 
if (Q.n_advisors < Q.n_advisors_start) Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
!}
max-visits: 1

= 改革派指導者が辞任

我々の政策選択は改革派を激怒させた。最も経験豊富な指導者の多くが辞任した。
